Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.07,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS}\N{\c&Hff8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.02,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.21,0:01:04.79,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Archelon: The Movie{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:03.44,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Summer and the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:05.91,Default(2),,0,0,0,,And today is an important audition!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.26,0:01:08.21,Default(2),,0,0,0,,I'll pass and become a star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:10.30,Default(2),,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:14.06,Default(2),,0,0,0,,why are you guys here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:16.69,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Because we are the organizers of the audition!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:19.09,Default(2),,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:20.32,Default(2),,0,0,0,,It's the role of a turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:21.83,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Huh? A turtle role?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:22.99,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Alright, without further ado...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:24.10,Default(2),,0,0,0,, Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:25.76,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:28.22,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:31.31,Default(2),,0,0,0,,I haven't even done anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:32.65,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.77,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Turtles are quadrupedal reptiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.39,0:01:36.89,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:40.57,Default(2),,0,0,0,,nowadays they are considered as close to dinosaurs as crocodiles are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.82,Dinosaurs,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\c&H5656FF&}Dinosaurs{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.82,Pterosaurs (Extinct),,0,0,0,,{\c&H004B96&}{\b1}Pterosaurs (Extinct){\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.82,Crocodilians,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5656FF&}{\b1}Crocodilians{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.82,Turtles,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5656FF&}{\b1}Turtles{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.79,0:01:44.49,Default(2),,0,0,0,,D-Dinosaurs...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.35,Default(2),,0,0,0,,You can do it, Kanna-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:48.71,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:49.67,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.21,0:01:53.11,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Quadrupedal reptile...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:55.01,Default(2),,0,0,0,,close to dinosaurs...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:00.91,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Looking good, Kanna-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:04.16,Default(2),,0,0,0,, With this, you can even play "that" turtle role!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:05.61,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:07.31,Default(2),,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "that" turtle role?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:12.31,Default(2),,0,0,0,,That is Archelon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:14.61,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Th-This turtle...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:16.94,Default(2),,0,0,0,,is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:17.85,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:22.31,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Archelon is said to be the largest ancient sea turtle in history!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:25.28,Default(2),,0,0,0,,A true big star in the sea turtle world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:26.50,Total length: 4 meters,,0,0,0,,{\c&H523D06&}{\c&HE3DF00&}{\c&H5B3F0A&}{\c&HFFE300&}Total length: 4 meters\NTotal width: 5 meters{\c&H523D06&}{\c&H523D06&}{\c&H523D06&}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:25.45,Habitat: Cretaceous North America,,0,0,0,,{\c&H523D06&}{\c&HE3DF00&}{\c&H5B3F0A&}{\c&HFFE300&}Habitat: Cretaceous North America
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.97,0:02:26.75,Default(2),,0,0,0,,So with that said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:28.88,Default(2),,0,0,0,,ready... Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:33.31,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Since it's that big, it must be pretty heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.05,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.43,0:02:38.81,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Archelon's shell
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:40.84,Default(2),,0,0,0,,was thoroughly lightweight;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:43.03,Default(2),,0,0,0,, its surface wasn't made of scales but a leathery skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:45.29,Default(2),,0,0,0,,and inside was just a framework of bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:47.72,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Its weight is said to be around 2 tons,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:50.15,Default(2),,0,0,0,,though there is also a theory that it was only about 400 kilograms!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:53.43,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Therefore, there's a possibility it could swim very fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.54,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Well, did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:56.91,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:00.68,Default(2),,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:02.35,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Can't you stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:06.09,Default(2),,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore! I quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:08.01,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:09.90,Default(2),,0,0,0,,When I can't even stand on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:12.88,Default(2),,0,0,0,,how could I ever become a big star like Archelon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:14.71,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Archelon has its weaknesses too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:17.35,Default(2),,0,0,0,,As a result of reducing too many bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:18.63,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Archelon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:23.78,Default(2),,0,0,0,,when laying eggs on land without buoyancy \Nfor long periods...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.20,Gravity,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF28F2&}{\c&HFF34E4&}Gravity{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.14,Danger,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFF5&}{\b1}DANGER{\b0}{\c&H5B3F0A&}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.23,0:03:29.12,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Archelon's internal organs would be crushed \Nunder its own weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:29.46,Danger,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFF5&}{\b1}DANGER{\b0}{\c&H5B3F0A&}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:30.52,Default(2),,0,0,0,,That's terrible then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:31.85,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:35.75,Default(2),,0,0,0,,While other creatures began giving birth in the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:39.34,Default(2),,0,0,0,,changes in the marine environment during the Late Cretaceous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:41.77,Default(2),,0,0,0,,caused many of them to perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:43.17,Default(2),,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.66,Default(2),,0,0,0,,that disaster didn't reach the sandy beaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:48.71,Default(2),,0,0,0,,The eggs of sea turtles like Archelon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:51.27,Default(2),,0,0,0,,who kept laying eggs on land, remained safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:55.87,Default(2),,0,0,0,,And that was precisely because they never gave up on laying their eggs on land!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:03:58.44,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Without giving up...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.13,Default(2),,0,0,0,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:03.51,Default(2),,0,0,0,,sea turtles were able to overcome the barrier of 66 million years ago and survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:05.34,Default(2),,0,0,0,,and survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:06.98,Default(2),,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.48,Default(2),,0,0,0,, won't give up after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:12.33,Default(2),,0,0,0,,I'm going to become bigger and bigger, \Njust like Archelon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.61,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Alright! That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.10,Default(2),,0,0,0,,What???
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.55,Default(2),,0,0,0,,She really became big!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:30.56,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Burst forth, my idol soul!
Dialogue: 3,0:04:32.24,0:04:34.92,Default(2),,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\fnTrebuchet MS}BIG BANG!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:40.86,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:45.34,Default(2),,0,0,0,,this world was made by the great turtles who never gave up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.53,Default(2),,0,0,0,,It's a brand new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:52.92,Default(2),,0,0,0,,Big...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.02,Default(2),,0,0,0,,I will become....
